          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.0,
            9.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the above theorem, ∆Zd/AnZd is the Laplacian on the discrete torus; ∆Zd is the Laplacian on",
          "bbox": [
            96.38,
            233.5,
            468.42,
            245.89
