            5.02,
            7.0,
            7.03,
            10.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the lattice Zd and ∆Rd/AZd is the Laplacian on the (continuous) torus Rd/AZd. The determinant",
          "bbox": [
            96.38,
            244.02,
            468.42,
            258.68
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMMI10",
